N:Words by J. Glyn Davies (1870–1953), from Alawon Cymru.
K:Dm
"Dm"A4 G2 F2 | "Dm"G2 A4 F2 | "A"E4 F2 E2 | "Dm"D6 D2 | "Gm"G6 G2 | "Bb"F2 G6 |
